* A1_conventional_cascode_mirror, testbench A_dc
* LTspice netlist (PTM 90 nm). Open in LTspice (File > Open, all files) and Run.
* DC transfer: plot -I(Vo) and V(inn) against Iin; error in %% = 100*(-I(Vo)-Iin)/Iin.
.include ptm90.lib
Vdd vdd 0 1
Vcn vcn 0 0.42
Vo out 0 0.5
M1C y vcn x 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M1 x y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M2C out vcn x2 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M2 x2 y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
Vjoin inn y 0
Iin 0 inn 10u AC 1
.dc Iin 0 20u 0.25u
.meas DC iout_10u FIND -I(Vo) AT=10u
.meas DC err_10u_pct PARAM 100*(iout_10u-10u)/10u
.meas DC vin_10u FIND V(inn) AT=10u
.meas DC iout_2u FIND -I(Vo) AT=2u
.meas DC err_2u_pct PARAM 100*(iout_2u-2u)/2u
.backanno
.end
